Package: m6APrediction
Title: Predicting m6A Sites Using a Random Forest
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Sihan", family = "Chen",
           email = "Sihan.Chen2403@student.xjtlu.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Predicts N6-methyladenosine (m6A) status at candidate RNA
    sites using a trained random forest model and sequence and genomic
    features. For a single site or a batch of sites, the package returns
    a predicted probability and a classification based on a user-specified
    probability threshold.
